FROM python:3.11-slim-bookworm@sha256:b1add8a6f2aca6bcfcf0b9c9b522352f7ce0d62a3d556a2f2f32511aa0cca250
ENV PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
COPY requirements.can_schema.lock /recipe/requirements.can_schema.lock
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r /recipe/requirements.can_schema.lock && pip check && pip freeze --all > /recipe/installed.can_schema.lock
RUN groupadd -g 1001 research && useradd -m -u 1001 -g 1001 research
USER 1001:1001
WORKDIR /study
